---
import core from '../../../lib/relational-collection/core.json';
const values=core.orders.map(o=>({...o,total:core.report_totals.find(t=>t.order_id===o.order_id).total}));
const sums=new Map(core.customers.map(c=>[c.customer_id,(values.filter(o=>o.customer_id===c.customer_id).reduce((s,o)=>s+Math.round(Number(o.total)*100),0)/100).toFixed(2)]));
---
<figure class="calculation" data-group-window aria-labelledby="r06-group-title">
 <figcaption id="r06-group-title"><span>Figure 1</span> A total beside a group, or beside each order</figcaption>
 <div class="choice" role="group" aria-label="Calculation shape"><button type="button" data-mode="group" aria-pressed="true">GROUP BY customer</button><button type="button" data-mode="window" aria-pressed="false">Window by customer</button></div>
 <p>Input: orders 101 (Mina, 39.50), 102 (Tariq, 40.00), 103 (Mina, 29.00).</p>
 <div data-group><table><caption>One row per customer with orders</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Customer</th><th scope="col">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody>{core.customers.filter(c=>values.some(o=>o.customer_id===c.customer_id)).map(c=><tr><th scope="row">{c.name}</th><td>{sums.get(c.customer_id)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 <div data-window hidden><table><caption>One row per order</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Order</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Customer total</th></tr></thead><tbody>{values.map(o=><tr><th scope="row">{o.order_id}</th><td>{o.total}</td><td>{sums.get(o.customer_id)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 <p data-explanation aria-live="polite">Mina’s two orders collapse to one group, worth 68.50. The three input rows become two output rows.</p>
 <details><summary>Both results as text</summary><p>Grouping returns Mina 68.50 and Tariq 40.00. The window retains 101, 102 and 103, with customer totals 68.50, 40.00 and 68.50 beside them. This is an illustration of the calculation, not database execution.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-group-window]').forEach(root=>root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-mode]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
 const windowed=button.dataset.mode==='window';root.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));
 (root.querySelector('[data-group]') as HTMLElement).hidden=windowed;(root.querySelector('[data-window]') as HTMLElement).hidden=!windowed;
 root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=windowed?'All three orders remain. Mina’s total of 68.50 is written beside both 101 and 103; it is the same total repeated, not another sale.':'Mina’s two orders collapse to one group, worth 68.50. The three input rows become two output rows.';
 })));
</script>
<style>
.calculation{margin:2.5rem 0;padding:1rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);font:.92rem/1.6 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:1rem}figcaption span{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.6rem}.choice{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.choice button{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);background:var(--color-surface-alt);color:var(--color-text);padding:.6rem .7rem;border-radius:.25rem;cursor:pointer}.choice button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--color-accent);border-color:var(--color-accent);color:var(--color-surface)}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}table{width:100%;display:table;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0}td,th{padding:.6rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong)}caption{text-align:left;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.8rem}td{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}[data-explanation]{min-height:5em;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding-left:.7rem}details{font-size:.85rem}[hidden]{display:none}
</style>
